Z||000002||Shaun41178||04-12-99||10:52 PM||||Shake it off Pretender.  It will be ok.  A couple of mods and you will be able to hang with your friends car.  Those AWD turbos are fairly quick.  I think the 0-60 times are right around mid 6's to 7 secs and qtr mile around low to mid 15's.  Stock Fieros really have no chance.  However give your car about 25-30 more hp and you should be able to take that import.  Or drop a 50 shot of nitrous on and that Talon will be seeing taillights for sure.
